    description: Some("Lost in an enchanted forest, you fire sparks from a magic wand at the Centipede winding down through a field of mushrooms. Each segment you hit turns into a mushroom. Dodge the leaping spider, the flea that drops straight down, and the scorpion whose poisoned mushrooms send the Centipede plunging toward you."),
